{
 "page": "MarioTennisRecompiled.html",
 "header": [
  "Mario Tennis' regular plan for play_page.mjs, 2-3 minutes with every timeout counted: the launcher, Load ROM once the",
  "page has its shader list (Chrome builds the whole list behind the launcher and says when it is done, and a click while",
  "it builds is lost; Firefox builds none there, and says so as the launcher comes up), the opening (the airship over the",
  "stadium: the program's \"code segment rom 0x00C6C320\" line), Start every 3.5 s through it until the title (the menus'",
  "code back at 0x800E8000, over the opening's), then the menus as a player goes through them, 3.5 s apart, as the menus",
  "take no press while a screen slides in: Start, then A for 1 Player, Mario, Exhibition, Singles, one set of two games,",
  "Luigi at Normal, and A on the Hard Court until the match's code is in (the opening's word at 0x800E2000 gone). Then",
  "100 s of the match on the console's own clock (0x80049a98, its VI count, 60 a second; the game's frame counter runs at",
  "half its menus' rate in a match): A every second, which serves (a press while he is ready tosses, the next hits;",
  "0.6-1.2 s after the toss hits, 1.5 s comes after he has caught the ball, and the first press after a point comes while",
  "the players walk back and does nothing) and swings, through the points, score screens and replays."
 ],
